WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.388
Step five computes two of the guide's
metrics from the exposure register.

2
00:00:04.388 --> 00:00:08.313
It reruns Module 1's public
I P query, then counts.

3
00:00:08.313 --> 00:00:12.312
Exposure ownership is the rows
with an owner over all rows.

4
00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:15.422
DDoS coverage is the
rows whose DDoS mode is

5
00:00:15.422 --> 00:00:19.137
Enabled or Virtual Network
Inherited, over all rows.

6
00:00:19.137 --> 00:00:24.037
The arithmetic is the path's own; the
definitions are the guide's metrics table.

7
00:00:24.037 --> 00:00:27.092
